>MbhA
“lobhād dveṣād bhayād vāpi yas tyajec charaṇāgataṃ | brahmahatyāsamaṃ tasya pāpam āhur manīṣiṇaḥ” ||
>MbhBh
lobhād dveṣād bhayād vāpi yas tyajec charaṇāgatam | brahmahatyāsamaṃ tasya pāpam āhur manīṣiṇaḥ ||
>MbhCc
lobhā-d dveṣā-d bhayā-d vāpi yas tyajec charaṇāgataṃ | brahmahatyāsaman tasya pāpam āhur manīṣiṇa ||
>MbhD
lobhād dveṣād bhayād vāpi yas tyajec charaṇāgatam | brahmahatyāsamaṃ tasya pāpam āhur manīṣiṇaḥ || 6 ||
>MbhD-A
lobhān mohād bhayād vāpi yas tyajec charaṇāgatam | brahmahatyāsamaṃ tasya pāpam āhur manīṣiṇaḥ || 6 ||
