lobhād dveṣād bhayād vāpi yas tyajec charaṇāgatam | brahmahatyāsamaṃ tasya pāpam āhur manīṣiṇaḥ ||
>MbhK-J
lobhā dveṣād upād vāpi yas tyajec charaṇāgatam | brahmahatyāsahasrasya pāpam āhur manīṣiṇaḥ ||
